{"t":"Time Ring Quest","s":"time-ring-quest-90a74","k":"quest","i":"assets/wiki/Time_Ring_Quest_Map_1c3a44.gif","q":1,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><div class=\"twbox\">\n<aside class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-twbox pi-layout-default\" role=\"region\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Time Ring Quest</h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">General</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"aka\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Aliases</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Shadowthorn Quest</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"log\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Quest Log</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Requirements</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"premium\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Premium</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"lvl\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Level</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">0<br/>(40 recommended)</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">7.1<br/><span class=\"implementation-date\">December 17, 2002<br/>Christmas Update 2002</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"status\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Status</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Active</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\">See also: Quests</nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-quest-legend\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Legend\">Legend</span></h3>\n<p class=\"no-results\">This quest has no legend.</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-quest-location\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Location\">Location</span></h3>\n<p><a href=\"#/wiki/Venore\">Venore</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Shadowthorn\">Shadowthorn</a>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-quest-dangers\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Dangers\">Dangers</span></h3>\n<p><a href=\"#/wiki/Elf%20Arcanist\">Elf Arcanists</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Elf%20Scout\">Elf Scouts</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Elf\">Elves</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Demon%20Skeleton\">Demon Skeleton</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Ghoul\">Ghoul</a>, possibly <a href=\"#/wiki/Dharalion\">Dharalion</a> (rare spawn)\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-quest-reward\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Reward\">Reward</span></h3>\n<p><a href=\"#/wiki/Time%20Ring\">Time Ring</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Elven%20Amulet\">Elven Amulet</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Crystal%20Ball\">Crystal Ball</a>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-quest-spoiler\">\n<div class=\"tw-cmd showhide-visible showhide-init quest-spoiler\" data-command=\"showhide-content\" data-showhide-value=\"visible\">\n<div class=\"showhide-header\" data-showhide-element=\"header\">Click to show/hide the quest spoiler.<br/><span style=\"font-size: 0.8em;\">(settings)</span></div>\n<div class=\"showhide-body\" data-showhide-element=\"body\">\n<div class=\"spoiler-pretext\">Spoiler • edit</div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Required_equipment\">Required equipment</span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Machete\">Machete</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Method\">Method</span></h2>\n<ul><li>Find your way to <a href=\"#/wiki/Shadowthorn\">Shadowthorn</a> and enter the hole <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"33060,32182,7\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (33060, 32182, 7)</a>.</li>\n<li>When you come down, head west.</li></ul>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Time Ring Quest Map\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"84\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Time_Ring_Quest_Map_1c3a44.gif\" width=\"97\"/></span>\n</p>\n<ul><li>Down the ramp you will find 4 <a href=\"#/wiki/Elf%20Arcanist\">Elf Arcanists</a>, at least 4 <a href=\"#/wiki/Elf%20Scout\">Elf Scouts</a>, two <a href=\"#/wiki/Ghoul\">Ghouls</a> and one <a href=\"#/wiki/Demon%20Skeleton\">Demon Skeleton</a>.</li>\n<li>Occasionally <a href=\"#/wiki/Dharalion\">Dharalion</a> spawns in the area.</li>\n<li>The three quest boxes are located in the north end of this room.</li></ul>\n<p><b>Suggestion.</b>\nGet a high level <a href=\"#/wiki/Knight\">knight</a> with enough hitpoints and <a href=\"#/wiki/Health%20Potions\">Health Potions</a> to run the creatures around while <a href=\"#/wiki/Paladin\">paladins</a> can shoot <a href=\"#/wiki/Bolt\">bolts</a> and HMMs runes at <a href=\"#/wiki/Demon%20Skeleton\">Demon Skeletons</a>, while mages can fire <a href=\"#/wiki/Sudden%20Death%20Rune\">SDs</a> at the <a href=\"#/wiki/Elf%20Arcanist\">Elf Arcanists</a>.\n</p><p>If you are a mage or a paladin, you should stand at the ramp and lure the monsters slowly because it is a big room and the monsters are spread out.\n</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div></div>","quests":["shadows-of-yalahar-quest"]}